      "message": "I think the assignment of `old_ce_pgd` is incorrect. `ce` contains the address of the new context from the new rte. It\u0027s assigned as follows:\n```\ncontext \u003d pkvm_phys_to_virt(param.rte \u0026 VTD_PAGE_MASK);\nce \u003d \u0026context[devfn];\n```\n`param.rte` is the new rte. \n\nThe correct assignment should be (given `root_entry[bus].lo` exists):\n`old_ce_pgd \u003d  root_entry[bus].lo[devfn].lo \u0026 VTD_PAGE_MASK;`",
